## STEP 1 — DELTA
- NEW auth.hornbach.com/token-srv/introspect: also accepts `application/json` body → 200 `{"active":false}` unauthenticated; gate is solely *body-presence* (empty body / query-only → 400 `unauthorized_client` "request body cant be empty") — request-shape model resolved
- NEW auth.hornbach.com/token-srv/token (issuance) → 400 `invalid_client` with zero client auth — **bypass isolated to the token-*management* plane**; issuance correctly enforces configured auth methods
- NEW auth.hornbach.com/users-srv/userinfo → 401 (token-gated): metadata leak chain fully requires a possessed token
- NEW auth.hornbach.com/session/check_session → 200 check-session iframe JS live; /session/end_session → 302
- NEW auth.hornbach.com/{health-srv,metrics-srv}: all sub-paths → 403 (IP-restricted namespaces, not anonymous-reachable)
- NEW api.hornbach.de/healthcheck → 200 `<status>ok</status>` with `Host: localhost:8080` echo + `Via: 1.0 sapigwprd02 (Gateway)x2` — internal node-name intel `sapigwprd02`; Host tamper (127.0.0.1/169.254.169.254/rfc1918) → uniform 503 edge-vhost reject → **no SSRF primitive confirmed**
