- NEW hornbach-mp.mirakl.net: /api/{orders,catalog/products,listings,accounts,payments,feeds,configurations,categories,attributes} → uniform 401 (standard L0 set); dummy-vs-missing key identical 401 → no anonymous bypass
- CHANGED www.hornbach.com → 301 → www.hornbach.de; both serve 3038-byte FingerprintJS challenge on ALL paths (incl /occ/v2, /storefront) — SAP Commerce OCC surface not reachable
- CHANGED APK path: de.hornbach main app absent from Google Play search (likely retired/PWA); APKMirror/APKPure/APKCombo/uptodown all bot-walled or 404
- RE-CONFIRMED: introspect POST form → 200 `{"active":false}`, revoke POST → 200 `OK` unauthenticated (stable across ≥4 sessions); auth.hornbach.de NetScaler 302→`/logon/LogonPoint/tmindex.html` + NSC_* cookies + CSP exposing `com.citrix.agmacepa`/`citrixng`/`vmware-view` schemes

